        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9036, Knurled Cabinet Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knurled Cabinet Knob is part of Omnia's Ultima III collection which features modern styles paired with beautiful finishes. This Knurled Cabinet Door Knob is available in 3 sizes. Each knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware. The textured cabinet knob is a perfect addition to any kitchen door or drawer. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/knurled-cabinet-pull-omnia-9037\"><b>Knurled Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/knurled-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9037p\"><b>Knurled Appliance Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9036 Textured Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9036/25:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9036/32:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9036/38:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
